flowchart TD
    User([Developer]) -->|runs| SH["agent.sh<br>(Host Entry Layer)"]
    SH -->|delegates| PY[".agent/ai_assistant.py<br>(Launcher Layer)"]
    PY -->|docker build| DF[".agent/Dockerfile.aider"]
    DF --> IMG[("paulgauthier/aider-full:latest")]
    PY -->|docker run + bind mount| CT["Docker Container<br>(Aider Runtime)"]
    PROJ[("Host Project Root<br>incl. .agent/")] -->|mounted into| CT
    CT --> ORCH[".agent/AGENTS.md<br>(Workflow Orchestration)"]
    ORCH -->|loads on demand| PL[".agent/.aider.prompt/**/SKILL.md<br>(Prompt Library)"]
    ORCH -->|loads on demand| CV[".agent/.aider.conventions/**<br>(Conventions)"]
    PL <-->|reads/writes| DOCS[("docs/<br>(SDLC Artifacts)")]
    CT -->|LLM API| LLM([LLM Provider])
